 "8696fa0535d28a6c7911dc0d9d26deb02b2267f0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Came for the meme, staying for the crab homies 🦀🦀🦀\n\nI am giving this game a solid 🦀/10.", "timestamp_created": 1709849308, "timestamp_updated": 1709849308, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 32, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "160064402", "author": {"steamid": "76561198126927531", "personaname": "Det. Tappdeeznutz", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/hookleon/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 367, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 228, "last_played": 1709890211, "avatar": "956d0c3867808830ca8e33daa1cb8e9c658faf42"}, "language": "english", "review": "Well made game, very polished for early access.", "timestamp_created": 1709848616, "timestamp_updated": 1709848616, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160064308", "author": {"steamid": "76561198203299588", "personaname": "Muscles McBuffStuff", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Doom_of_Judgment/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 361, "playtime_forever": 2370, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 85, "last_played": 1766962845, "avatar": "3154054ff743c3ecd48a00e0811de404702b314f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yeah, this game is amazing, feels like a 3rd Person DOOM Eternal arena shooter with multiple rooms, with slightly less violence. Everything in the game is unlock-able and not hidden behind a paywall which is great, but please guys, don't pull a \"Tower Unite\" on us. For those who are unfamiliar, Tower Unite is a game that's been in early access for what feels like forever, and has plastered in about 3 or 4 different parts of it's steam description this following saying \"No microtransactions, subscription fees, or paid DLC. Every content update is free\" and then they released a paid DLC which locks in game items behind a paywall, now you may be thinking if you go and look at those \"But Doom, those are useless items anyway and they aren't exactly exciting\" The point is they promised they wouldn't have anything like that, yet they charged $15 for a \"Supporter Pack\" which IS LOCKING items behind a paywall meaning the only way to obtain those particular items is to Pay $15 for it. But so far Crab Champions is amazing and i'd Highly recommend this game to anyone looking for a fun time to blast some enemies way with weapons, with some RNG thrown in the mix.", "timestamp_created": 1709848503, "timestamp_updated": 1709848503, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160063538", "author": {"steamid": "76561198199595253", "personaname": "LeFant", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198199595253/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 5214, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 140, "last_played": 1744405629, "avatar": "a627d3c0e9fe310d6ce9538c3594376522acbb00"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game is awesome!\ncool music - check\ncool gameplay - check\nmultiplayer -check\nRECOMMENDED!!", "timestamp_created": 1709847584, "timestamp_updated": 1709847584